<title>USA: Citizens Corp Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Citizens Corp Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, Mass. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.77		    $0.58</p>
<p> Oper shr		    0.78		     0.51</p>
<p> Net			 27,100		   20,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  35,300		   36,100</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.74		    $1.51</p>
<p> Oper shr		    1.48		     1.44</p>
<p> Net			 61,700		   56,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  35,500		   36,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1996 included $600,000 after-tax realized investment losses. Q3 1995 included $2.5 million after-tax realized investment gains. At September 30, results included $9.2 million and $2.7 million of after-tax realized investment gains in 1996 and 1995, respectively.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
